  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the tangent to the parabola is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Equation of the tangent to the circle is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br />For common tangent<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;Equation of the tangents are <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Point of intersection of these tangents is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  }
